                        <p style="text-align: justify">Account holder(s) should report all changes in his/her tax residency status and/or other personal information to Phillip Securities (Hong Kong) Limited ("PSHK"), you could log in POEMS or visit the head office or branches of PSHK to amend your personal particulars.</p>
